## Title: Guidelime |cff66ff66Forever Alliance 1-30|r
## Notes: Braedyn's Alliance levelling route for WoW Forever - Dwarf Shaman and Dwarf/Human Hunter, class and race steps filtered automatically. 1-20: Eastern Kingdoms, Hall of Thanes + Deadmines (24-25 Sep 2026, audited 17 Oct against QuestieDB Forever 1.0.6). 20-30 (18 Oct 2026): Ruins of Lordaeron, Loch Modan, Redridge, Darkshore, Ashenvale + Blackfathom Deeps, Duskwood, the Stockade, Wetlands, Darnassus, Excavation Site, Hillsbrad, Gnomeregan, Razorfen Kraul - every Alliance dungeon quest in the bracket, Call of Water and Call of Air for the shaman. 25 Oct: launch-crowd layer in 1-15, Call of Water finale moved to Westfall, shaman fixes, Dalaran lead-ins carried from 15/23. 27 Oct: cooking + fishing layer (Longjaw Mud Snapper and Mithril Head Trout food plan, Journeyman/Expert steps, fish-to-N stops, Seasoned Wolf Kabobs), drop-rate pass (Never Saddle on Quality retargeted to Elder Snow Leopards; Show of Force, The Quarry's Smith and Slowing the Orc Advance dropped; kill budgets and one-kill notes).
## Author: Braedyn (with Claude)
